    "title": "Spider Solitaire Classic",
    "description": "Spider Solitaire Classic is an addictive and relaxing card game!\r\n\r\nThe BEST Spider Solitaire card game is FREE now! Spider Solitaire Classic is the perfect puzzle game that not only kill your spare time but also train your brain! It is an offline game that you can play it anytime and anywhere! \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1fHighlights\ud83c\udf1f\r\n\u2665 Classic gameplay of Spider Solitaire\r\n\u2665 Very Big and Easy-to-see cards\r\n\u2665 Play Spider Solitaire games with any difficulty you like\r\n\u2665 Train your brain by completing fun Daily Challenges & Goals\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1fKey Features\ud83c\udf1f\r\n\u2660 Complete Daily Challenges to collect trophies\r\n\u2660 Play Right or Left-handed\r\n\u2660Customization: Change your background, card backs and card faces for a personalized experience\r\n\u2660 Unlimited hints and Undoes\r\n\u2660 Intelligent hints\r\n\u2660 Auto-collect cards on completion\r\n\u2660 Play offline anytime and anywhere\r\n\r\nIf you like Classic Solitaire, FreeCell Solitaire, Pyramid Solitaire and other card games, which require skill, strategy and a lot of patience, then this spider solitaire is the best choice for you.\r\n\r\nDownload this card game for free, and play with your friends now!",
